    "description": "What is your favorite Mew card? \n\nThis is probably my favorite! But I also really love the bubble Mew, ancient Mew and the Mew & Mewtwo tag team!\n\nAlso, did you know that Mew started the trend of every generation until Generation 6 introducing a Mythical with a base stat total of 600 and a stat distribution of 100 all around. Other Pokemon that follow this trend include Celebi, Jirachi, Manaphy, Land Forme Shaymin, and Victini. Which is your favorite of these? I think for me it would either be Celebi or Land Forme Shaymin!\n.\n.\n.\n#pokemoncards #tradingcards #pokemon #pokemontcg #pokemonfan",
